                        "Positive Rate - Period By Language",
                        "Negative Rate - Period By Language"
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "execution_config": {
        "execution_mode": "parallel",
        "retry_policy": {
            "max_retries": 3,
            "retry_delay": "1s"
        },
        "timeout": "600s",
        "deterministic": true,
        "cache_results": true
    },
    "report_template": "# Opinion Daily Report - {game_name}\n\n请根据以下收集到的数据，严格按照以下模板格式生成专业的舆情日报：\n\n## 数据来源\n- Agent执行结果: {all_results}\n- 数据查询结果: {bidata}\n\n# Opinion Daily Report\n请根据以下收集到的数据，按照以下模板格式生成专业的舆情日报：\n\n## 报告模板格式\n\n### Steam\n#### Overview\n{{Summary}}\n请基于Steam相关数据生成概述，包括整体评价趋势、用户反馈概况等。\n\n#### 数据表格\n| Time Period | Total Reviews | Positive Reviews | Negative Reviews | Positive Rate |\n|-------------|---------------|------------------|------------------|---------------|\n| SelectPeriod       | [数据]        | [数据]           | [数据]           | [数据]         |\n| Lifetime    | [数据]        | [数据]           | [数据]           | [数据]         |\n\n#### 趋势图表\n**Last 24H Hourly Trend - Stacked Bar Chart with Line Chart**\n- positive reviews / negative reviews / positive rate\n\n**Daily Trend since Launch Stacked Bar Chart with Line Chart**\n- positive reviews / negative reviews / positive rate\n\n#### Steam Reviews Topics\n**Top 5 Positive Topics with Examples**\n- Topic P1 (number of reviews, percentage)\n  - Example Reviews\n    - Example A\n    - Example B\n    - Example C\n    - Example D\n    - Example E\n- Topic P2 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P3 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P4 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P5 (number of reviews, percentage)\n\n**Top 5 Negative Topics with Examples**\n- Topic N1 (number of reviews, percentage)\n  - Example Reviews\n    - Example F\n    - Example G\n    - Example H\n    - Example I\n    - Example J\n- Topic N2 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N3 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N4 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N5 (number of reviews, percentage)\n\n### Social Media\n#### Overview\n{{Summary}}\n请基于社交媒体相关数据生成概述。\n\n#### 数据表格\n| Time Period | Mentions | Sentiment | Negative Reviews | Positive Rate |\n|-------------|----------|-----------|------------------|---------------|\n| Today       | [数据]   | [数据]    | [数据]           | [数据]         |\n| Yesterday   | [数据]   | [数据]    | [数据]           | [数据]         |\n\n#### Key Topics\n**Top 5 Positive Topics with Examples (total Mentions: [数据], [百分比])**\n- Topic P1 (number of reviews, percentage)\n  - Example Reviews\n    - Example A\n    - Example B\n    - Example C\n    - Example D\n    - Example E\n- Topic P2 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P3 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P4 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic P5 (number of reviews, percentage)\n\n**Top 5 Negative Topics with Examples**\n- Topic N1 (number of reviews, percentage)\n  - Example Reviews\n    - Example F\n    - Example G\n    - Example H\n    - Example I\n    - Example J\n- Topic N2 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N3 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N4 (number of reviews, percentage)\n- Topic N5 (number of reviews, percentage)\n\n### Community Data Highlights\n#### Channel Distribution\n| Channel | Total Mentions | Avg Sentiment | Positive% | Negative% |\n|---------|----------------|-----------|-----------|-----------|\n| [渠道1] | [数据]         | [数据]    | [数据]    | [数据]    |\n| [渠道2] | [数据]         | [数据]    | [数据]    | [数据]    |\n| ...     | ...            | ...       | ...       | ...       |\n\n#### Language Distribution\n| Language | Total Mentions | Avg Sentiment |  Positive% | Negative% |\n|----------|----------------|------------|-----------|-----------|\n| [语言1]  | [数据]         | [数据]     | [数据]    | [数据]    |\n| [语言2]  | [数据]         | [数据]     | [数据]    | [数据]    |\n| ...      | ...            | ...        | ...       | ...       |\n\n## 重要要求：\n1. 按照上述模板格式输出，不要添加额外的内容\n2. 从提供的数据中提取相应的数值填入表格\n3. 如果某些数据未获取，禁止编造或生成数据\n4. 确保所有数据都基于实际收集到的信息\n5. 保持专业的报告语调\n6. 使用Markdown格式输出，确保表格和列表格式正确\n\n请开始生成报告："
}